## Approval boundary

Approval of this plan would authorize I0 through I5 within the existing repository and quarantine boundaries. It would not authorize:

- package admission merely because bytes exist;
- formula or inventory mutation from package claims;
- procurement;
- physical compounding;
- database promotion of template rows;
- migration `0017` without a demonstrated lossless-fit failure;
- publication or release.

